{"metadata":{"title":[{"Plain":"局部意象"},2],"author":[{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},4],"slug":[{"Plain":"局部意象"},0],"ext":[{"Plain":"md"},1],"tag":[{"Plain":"百科"},3]},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<h2>观念</h2>\n<p>局部意象是仅含有一个点 $x$ 及其 “局部” 的"},{"Local":{"url":"意象","text":"意象"}},{"Plain":"; 其表现为意象的"},{"Local":{"url":"整体截面","text":"整体截面"}},{"Plain":" $\\Gamma$ 等同于这一点处的"},{"Local":{"url":"茎","text":"茎"}},{"Plain":" $(-)_x$.</p>\n<h2>定义</h2>\n<p>对于"},{"Local":{"url":"带点意象","text":"带点意象"}},{"Plain":" $(\\mathcal X,x)$ 有自然变换\n$$\r\n\\Gamma(X,-)\\to (-)_x := x^*.\r\n$$</p>\n<p>当上述自然变换为同构时, 称 $(\\mathcal X,x)$ 为<strong>局部意象</strong>.</p>\n<h2>性质</h2>\n<p>对于局部意象 $(\\mathcal X,x)$, 记 $p\\colon \\mathcal X\\to\\mathrm{pt}$ 为到点的"},{"Local":{"url":"几何态射","text":"几何态射"}},{"Plain":", 有三元伴随\n$$\r\np^* \\dashv (p_* = x^*) \\dashv x_*.\r\n$$\n此时 $p\\colon \\mathcal X\\to\\mathrm{pt}$ 是 $x\\colon \\mathrm{pt}\\to\\mathcal X$ 在意象的 $2$-范畴中的左"},{"Local":{"url":"伴随","text":"伴随"}},{"Plain":".</p>\n"}]}}